        "TileImage": "$($repository a80bb6dd-5290-4c5f-a8c8-f3568c8425fa).Image",
        "Description": "Briefing:\r\r47,  you will be heading to Sapienza, Italy  Bee&apos;s hometown  as we have found a lead on a political party being held by his best advisor,  Enzo Genovese (Marco Abbiatti) . We have also located Enzo&apos;s head of security, Peter Profiterole and his personal attourney  Silvia Morando. This  contract applies to all the persons previously listed, and Silvia Morando&apos;s personal bodyguard. \r\rGood luck 47, and don&apos;t screw this one up.",
